{"code":"ko","name":"Korean","native":"한국어","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"A2","level":{"title":"Elementary: past, desires, places, food","goals":["Talk about past with 었어요/였어요","Express wants with -고 싶어요","Move around, eat out and shop"],"units":[{"id":"A2-U1","title":"Past and desires","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U1-L1","title":"Past: 먹었어요/였어요","learn":"Past power! 먹어요→먹었어요 (ate), 가요→갔어요 (went). 입니다→이었어요/였어요: 학생이었어요 (was a student). Time words: 어제 (yesterday), 오늘 (today), 내일 (tomorrow)!","vocab":[{"t":"어제","r":"eoje","en":"yesterday","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"오늘","r":"oneul","en":"today","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"내일","r":"nae-il","en":"tomorrow","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"아침","r":"achim","en":"morning","pos":"noun"},{"t":"저녁","r":"jeonyeok","en":"evening","pos":"noun"},{"t":"밤","r":"bam","en":"night","pos":"noun"},{"t":"그리고","r":"geurigo","en":"and / then","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"이미","r":"imi","en":"already","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"었/았어요 · 이었어요","explain":"먹→먹었어요, 가→갔어요, 하→했어요. 학생이었어요 (was a student), 아니었어요 (wasn't). 이미 + past = already: 이미 먹었어요!","pattern":"었/았어요 · 이었어요/였어요","examples":[{"t":"어제 책을 읽었어요.","r":"eoje chaeg-eul ilg-eosseoyo.","en":"Yesterday I read a book."},{"t":"학생이었어요.","r":"haksaeng-i-eoss-eoyo.","en":"I was a student."},{"t":"이미 먹었어요.","r":"imi meog-eoss-eoyo.","en":"I already ate."}],"mistakes":["Saying 먹었어요 for habits — 었어요 = finished past!","Saying 입니다었어요 — 입니다 becomes 이었어요/였어요!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"지훈","t":"어제 뭐 했어요?","r":"eoje mwo haess-eoyo?","en":"What did you do yesterday?"},{"sp":"미나","t":"공부했어요. 그리고 놀았어요!","r":"gongbu-haess-eoyo. geurigo nol-ass-eoyo!","en":"I studied. And I played!"},{"sp":"지훈","t":"저는 일했어요.","r":"jeo-neun il-haess-eoyo.","en":"I worked."},{"sp":"미나","t":"수고했어요!","r":"sugo-haess-eoyo!","en":"Good work!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Yesterday I read a book","answer":"어제 책을 읽었어요"},{"type":"fill","q":"학생___. (was)","answer":"이었어요"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I already ate' is…","options":["이미 먹어요","이미 먹었어요","아직 먹어요","안 먹었어요"],"answer":"이미 먹었어요"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 읽었어요 / 책을 / 어제","answer":"어제 책을 읽었어요"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 어제 책을 읽었어요.","answer":"어제 책을 읽었어요."}],"quiz":[{"q":"먹었어요 means…","options":["eat","ate","don't eat","will eat"],"answer":1,"why":"었어요 = past."},{"q":"이었어요 means…","options":["is","was","isn't","will be"],"answer":1,"why":"입니다→이었어요."},{"q":"어제 means…","options":["today","yesterday","tomorrow","tonight"],"answer":1,"why":"어제 = yesterday."},{"q":"이미 means…","options":["then","already","late","never"],"answer":1,"why":"이미 = already."},{"q":"그리고 means…","options":["but","and / then","never","always"],"answer":1,"why":"그리고 = and/then."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Past tense worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Korean.","items":["yesterday","already","and / then"],"key":["어제","이미","그리고"]},{"instruction":"Make pasts.","items":["I read (a book)","I was a student","I already ate"],"key":["읽었어요","학생이었어요","이미 먹었어요"]},{"instruction":"Talk yesterday.","items":["What did you do yesterday?","Good work!"],"key":["어제 뭐 했어요","수고했어요"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U1-L2","title":"Want: -고 싶어요","learn":"Desire grammar! -고 싶어요 (I want to…): 먹고 싶어요 (want to eat), 가고 싶어요 (want to go). Requests: -아/어 주세요 (please do): 봐 주세요! Want + please = unstoppable!","vocab":[{"t":"먹고 싶어요","r":"meokgo sip-eoyo","en":"want to eat","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"마시고 싶어요","r":"masigo sip-eoyo","en":"want to drink","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"가고 싶어요","r":"gago sip-eoyo","en":"want to go","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"보고 싶어요","r":"bogo sip-eoyo","en":"want to see / miss","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"자고 싶어요","r":"jago sip-eoyo","en":"want to sleep","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"쉬고 싶어요","r":"swigo sip-eoyo","en":"want to rest","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"놀고 싶어요","r":"nolgo sip-eoyo","en":"want to play","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"배우고 싶어요","r":"bae-ugo sip-eoyo","en":"want to learn","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"-고 싶어요 · -아/어 주세요","explain":"먹고 싶어요 (want to eat), 자고 싶어요 (want to sleep). 보고 싶어요 ALSO means I MISS you! Requests: 도와주세요 (please help), 보여 주세요 (please show)!","pattern":"verb-고 싶어요 · verb-아/어 주세요","examples":[{"t":"김치를 먹고 싶어요!","r":"gimchi-reul meokgo sip-eoyo!","en":"I want to eat kimchi!"},{"t":"보고 싶어요!","r":"bogo sip-eoyo!","en":"I miss you! / I want to see (you)!"},{"t":"도와주세요!","r":"dowajuseyo!","en":"Please help!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 먹고 싶다 to elders — polite: 싶어요!","Saying 보고 싶어 for missing — needs 보고 싶어요!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"미나","t":"뭐 먹고 싶어요?","r":"mwo meokgo sip-eoyo?","en":"What do you want to eat?"},{"sp":"지훈","t":"김치를 먹고 싶어요!","r":"gimchi-reul meokgo sip-eoyo!","en":"I want to eat kimchi!"},{"sp":"미나","t":"저는 자고 싶어요!","r":"jeo-neun jago sip-eoyo!","en":"I want to sleep!"},{"sp":"지훈","t":"보고 싶을 거예요!","r":"bogo sip-eul geo-yeyo!","en":"I'll miss you!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I want to eat kimchi","answer":"김치를 먹고 싶어요"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ 싶어요! (I miss you)","answer":"보고"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Please help!' is…","options":["도와요","도와주세요","도왔어요","도울 거예요"],"answer":"도와주세요"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 싶어요 / 먹고","answer":"먹고 싶어요"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 김치를 먹고 싶어요!","answer":"김치를 먹고 싶어요!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"먹고 싶어요 means…","options":["I eat","I want to eat","I ate","I can eat"],"answer":1,"why":"-고 싶어요 = want to."},{"q":"보고 싶어요 ALSO means…","options":["I see","I miss you","I watch","I look"],"answer":1,"why":"보고 싶어요 = miss/see-want."},{"q":"도와주세요 means…","options":["I help","please help","I helped","helping now"],"answer":1,"why":"-아/어 주세요 = please do."},{"q":"자고 싶어요 means…","options":["I sleep","I want to sleep","I slept","I can sleep"],"answer":1,"why":"자고 + 싶어요."},{"q":"쉬고 싶어요 means…","options":["I rest","I want to rest","I rested","I can rest"],"answer":1,"why":"쉬고 + 싶어요."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Desires worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Korean.","items":["want to eat","want to go","want to learn"],"key":["먹고 싶어요","가고 싶어요","배우고 싶어요"]},{"instruction":"Want things.","items":["I want to eat kimchi","I want to sleep","I miss you"],"key":["김치를 먹고 싶어요","자고 싶어요","보고 싶어요"]},{"instruction":"Ask and request.","items":["What do you want to eat?","Please help!"],"key":["뭐 먹고 싶어요","도와주세요"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U2","title":"Places and movement","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U2-L1","title":"Particles: 에/에서/으로","learn":"Place particles! 에 (to/at-point), 에서 (action-at/from), 으로 (toward/by). 학교에 가요 (go to school), 학교에서 공부해요 (study AT school), 버스로 가요 (go BY bus)! 여기/거기/저기 = here/there/over there!","vocab":[{"t":"도시","r":"dosi","en":"city","pos":"noun"},{"t":"길","r":"gil","en":"street / road","pos":"noun"},{"t":"가게","r":"gage","en":"shop","pos":"noun"},{"t":"일","r":"il","en":"work","pos":"noun"},{"t":"공원","r":"gong-won","en":"park","pos":"noun"},{"t":"박물관","r":"bangmulgwan","en":"museum","pos":"noun"},{"t":"역","r":"yeok","en":"station","pos":"noun"},{"t":"여기","r":"yeogi","en":"here","pos":"pronoun"}],"grammar":{"title":"에 (to) · 에서 (at) · 으로 (by)","explain":"학교에 가요 (go to school), 집에 있어요 (am at home), 학교에서 공부해요 (study at school), 버스로 가요 (go by bus)!","pattern":"에 + go · 에서 + action · 으로 + vehicle","examples":[{"t":"학교에 가요.","r":"hakgyo-e gayo.","en":"I go to school."},{"t":"집에 있어요.","r":"jib-e iss-eoyo.","en":"I am at home."},{"t":"학교에서 공부해요.","r":"hakgyo-eseo gongbuhaeyo.","en":"I study at school."}],"mistakes":["Saying 학교에서 가요 — going needs 에!","Saying 학교에 공부해요 — actions need 에서!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"미나","t":"어디에 가요?","r":"eodi-e gayo?","en":"Where are you going?"},{"sp":"지훈","t":"학교에 가요!","r":"hakgyo-e gayo!","en":"I go to school!"},{"sp":"미나","t":"저는 가게에 가요.","r":"jeo-neun gage-e gayo.","en":"I go to the shop."},{"sp":"지훈","t":"잘 다녀오세요!","r":"jal danyeo-oseyo!","en":"Have a good trip!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I go to school","answer":"학교에 가요"},{"type":"fill","q":"학교___ 공부해요. (action-at)","answer":"에서"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Where are you going?' is…","options":["어디에 있어요","어디에 가요","어디예요","뭐 해요"],"answer":"어디에 가요"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 가요 / 학교에","answer":"학교에 가요"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 학교에 가요.","answer":"학교에 가요."}],"quiz":[{"q":"에 marks…","options":["action-at","to/at-point","vehicle","object"],"answer":1,"why":"에 = to/at."},{"q":"에서 marks…","options":["direction","action-at","object","time"],"answer":1,"why":"학교에서 = at-school-doing."},{"q":"버스로 가요 means…","options":["go to the bus","go by bus","go with bus","see the bus"],"answer":1,"why":"으로 = by/via."},{"q":"역 means…","options":["museum","station","school","park"],"answer":1,"why":"역 = station."},{"q":"잘 다녀오세요! is said…","options":["on arrival","when seeing off","at night","at meals"],"answer":1,"why":"잘 다녀오세요 = go-and-return-well!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Particles worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Korean.","items":["city","park","here"],"key":["도시","공원","여기"]},{"instruction":"에 or 에서?","items":["I go to school → …에","I study at school → …에서","I am at home → …에"],"key":["학교에 가요","학교에서 공부해요","집에 있어요"]},{"instruction":"Going out.","items":["Where are you going?","Have a good trip!"],"key":["어디에 가요","잘 다녀오세요"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U2-L2","title":"가요/와요/돌아가요","learn":"Move! 가요 (go), 와요 (come), 돌아가요 (return). Time + 에: 여섯 시에 (at 6). 내일 학교에 가요 = Tomorrow I go to school. Leaving: 다녀오겠습니다! Back: 다녀왔어요!","vocab":[{"t":"가요","r":"gayo","en":"to go","pos":"verb"},{"t":"와요","r":"wayo","en":"to come","pos":"verb"},{"t":"돌아가요","r":"dor-agayo","en":"to return","pos":"verb"},{"t":"서울","r":"seoul","en":"Seoul","pos":"noun"},{"t":"한국","r":"hanguk","en":"Korea","pos":"noun"},{"t":"집","r":"jip","en":"home","pos":"noun"},{"t":"식탁","r":"siktak","en":"table","pos":"noun"},{"t":"영화","r":"yeonghwa","en":"movie","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"Movement + 시에","explain":"여섯 시에 가요 (go at 6), 내일 와요 (come tomorrow). Leaving home: 다녀오겠습니다! Return: 다녀왔어요! Family: 잘 다녀왔어요!","pattern":"time + 에 + movement","examples":[{"t":"여섯 시에 가요.","r":"yeoseot si-e gayo.","en":"I go at six."},{"t":"내일 서울에 가요.","r":"nae-il seoul-e gayo.","en":"Tomorrow I go to Seoul."},{"t":"다녀오겠습니다!","r":"danyeo-ogetseumnida!","en":"I'm off (and back)!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 여섯 시 가요 without 에 — clock-times need 에!","Saying 안녕히 가세요 when YOU leave — you say 다녀오겠습니다!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"지훈","t":"다녀오겠습니다!","r":"danyeo-ogetseumnida!","en":"I'm off!"},{"sp":"미나","t":"잘 다녀오세요!","r":"jal danyeo-oseyo!","en":"Have a good trip!"},{"sp":"지훈","t":"다녀왔어요!","r":"danyeo-wass-eoyo!","en":"I'm home!"},{"sp":"미나","t":"잘 다녀왔어요!","r":"jal danyeo-wass-eoyo!","en":"Welcome back!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I go at six","answer":"여섯 시에 가요"},{"type":"fill","q":"___! (I'm off!)","answer":"다녀오겠습니다"},{"type":"choose","q":"Answer to 다녀왔어요 is…","options":["다녀오겠습니다","잘 다녀왔어요","잘 다녀오세요","안녕하세요"],"answer":"잘 다녀왔어요"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 가요 / 여섯 시에","answer":"여섯 시에 가요"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 다녀오겠습니다!","answer":"다녀오겠습니다!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"다녀오겠습니다! means…","options":["goodbye forever","I'm off (and back)","welcome home","good night"],"answer":1,"why":"I'll go and return!"},{"q":"다녀왔어요! means…","options":["I'm off","I'm home","welcome","goodbye"],"answer":1,"why":"다녀왔어요 = returned!"},{"q":"여섯 시에 needs 에 because…","options":["place","clock-time","object","question"],"answer":1,"why":"Time-points take 에."},{"q":"돌아가요 means…","options":["to go","to come","to return","to stay"],"answer":2,"why":"돌아가요 = return."},{"q":"영화 means…","options":["book","movie","music","game"],"answer":1,"why":"영화 = movie."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Movement worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Korean.","items":["to go","to come","home"],"key":["가요","와요","집"]},{"instruction":"Move with time.","items":["I go at six","Tomorrow I go to Seoul"],"key":["여섯 시에 가요","내일 서울에 가요"]},{"instruction":"Home rituals.","items":["I'm off! / Have a good trip!","I'm home! / Welcome back!"],"key":["다녀오겠습니다 / 잘 다녀오세요","다녀왔어요 / 잘 다녀왔어요"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U3","title":"Food and shopping","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U3-L1","title":"좋아해요 / 원해요","learn":"Likes and wants! 생선을 좋아해요 (I like fish), 물을 원해요 (I want water). 을/를 marks liked/wanted things! 너무 좋아해요 = love it! Order: 김치 주세요!","vocab":[{"t":"밥","r":"bap","en":"rice / meal","pos":"noun"},{"t":"우유","r":"uyu","en":"milk","pos":"noun"},{"t":"치즈","r":"chijeu","en":"cheese","pos":"noun"},{"t":"고기","r":"gogi","en":"meat","pos":"noun"},{"t":"생선","r":"saengseon","en":"fish","pos":"noun"},{"t":"사과","r":"sagwa","en":"apple","pos":"noun"},{"t":"차","r":"cha","en":"tea","pos":"noun"},{"t":"커피","r":"keopi","en":"coffee","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"을/를 좋아해요/원해요","explain":"생선을 좋아해요 (I like fish), 차를 원해요 (I want tea). 좋아해요 verbs take 을/를! 너무 = too/very: 너무 좋아해요 = love!","pattern":"X 을/를 + 좋아해요/원해요","examples":[{"t":"생선을 좋아해요.","r":"saengseon-eul jo-ahaeyo.","en":"I like fish."},{"t":"차를 원해요.","r":"cha-reul wonhaeyo.","en":"I want tea."},{"t":"김치를 너무 좋아해요!","r":"gimchi-reul neomu jo-ahaeyo!","en":"I love kimchi!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 생선이 좋아해요 — likes need 을/를!","Saying 원해요 for actions — actions: -고 싶어요!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"미나","t":"뭐 좋아해요?","r":"mwo jo-ahaeyo?","en":"What do you like?"},{"sp":"지훈","t":"생선을 좋아해요!","r":"saengseon-eul jo-ahaeyo!","en":"I like fish!"},{"sp":"미나","t":"저는 차를 원해요!","r":"jeo-neun cha-reul wonhaeyo!","en":"I want tea!"},{"sp":"지훈","t":"저도 커피를 원해요!","r":"jeo-do keopi-reul wonhaeyo!","en":"I want coffee too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I like fish","answer":"생선을 좋아해요"},{"type":"fill","q":"차를 ___. (want)","answer":"원해요"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I love kimchi!' is…","options":["김치를 먹어요","김치를 너무 좋아해요","김치를 원해요","김치 주세요"],"answer":"김치를 너무 좋아해요"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 좋아해요 / 생선을","answer":"생선을 좋아해요"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 생선을 좋아해요.","answer":"생선을 좋아해요."}],"quiz":[{"q":"생선을 좋아해요 uses 을 because…","options":["subject","liked-object marker","place","time"],"answer":1,"why":"좋아해요 takes 을/를!"},{"q":"원해요 means…","options":["I like","I want","I eat","I drink"],"answer":1,"why":"원해요 = want (things)."},{"q":"치즈 means…","options":["milk","cheese","meat","fish"],"answer":1,"why":"치즈 = cheese."},{"q":"너무 좋아해요 means…","options":["like","love","want","need"],"answer":1,"why":"너무 = very — love!"},{"q":"도 means…","options":["too / also","not","please","very"],"answer":0,"why":"저도 = me too."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Likes worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Korean.","items":["fish","tea","apple"],"key":["생선","차","사과"]},{"instruction":"Like and want.","items":["I like fish","I want tea","I love kimchi"],"key":["생선을 좋아해요","차를 원해요","김치를 너무 좋아해요"]},{"instruction":"Ask.","items":["What do you like?","Me too!"],"key":["뭐 좋아해요","저도"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U3-L2","title":"Shopping: 얼마예요","learn":"Shop in Korean! 얼마예요? (How much?), 비싸요 (expensive), 싸요 (cheap). Money: 원 (won). 이거 주세요 = I'll take this! Staff greet: 어서 오세요 (welcome)!","vocab":[{"t":"가격","r":"gagyeok","en":"price","pos":"noun"},{"t":"돈","r":"don","en":"money","pos":"noun"},{"t":"원","r":"won","en":"won","pos":"noun"},{"t":"영수증","r":"yeongsujeung","en":"receipt","pos":"noun"},{"t":"할인","r":"hal-in","en":"discount","pos":"noun"},{"t":"비싸요","r":"bissayo","en":"expensive","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"싸요","r":"ssayo","en":"cheap","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"공짜","r":"gongjja","en":"free","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"얼마예요? + 주세요","explain":"이거 얼마예요? (How much is this?), 백 원이에요 (100 won). 이거 주세요 = this, please! 비싸요! = Expensive!","pattern":"얼마예요? · X 주세요","examples":[{"t":"이거 얼마예요?","r":"igeo eolmayeyo?","en":"How much is this?"},{"t":"백 원이에요.","r":"baek won-ieyo.","en":"It's 100 won."},{"t":"이거 주세요!","r":"igeo juseyo!","en":"This, please!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 얼마까 — shopping-how-much is 얼마예요!","Saying 이거를 주세요 — drop 를: 이거 주세요!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"미나","t":"이거 얼마예요?","r":"igeo eolmayeyo?","en":"How much is this?"},{"sp":"지훈","t":"백 원이에요.","r":"baek won-ieyo.","en":"It's 100 won."},{"sp":"미나","t":"비싸요! 치즈는 얼마예요?","r":"bissayo! chijeu-neun eolmayeyo?","en":"Expensive! How much is the cheese?"},{"sp":"지훈","t":"싸요! 이거 주세요!","r":"ssayo! igeo juseyo!","en":"It's cheap! I'll take this!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How much is this?","answer":"이거 얼마예요"},{"type":"fill","q":"백 ___이에요. (won)","answer":"원"},{"type":"choose","q":"'This, please!' is…","options":["이거 있어요","이거 주세요","이거 원해요","이거 얼마"],"answer":"이거 주세요"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 얼마예요 / 이거","answer":"이거 얼마예요"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 이거 얼마예요?","answer":"이거 얼마예요?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"얼마예요? means…","options":["How many?","How much?","Where is?","What is?"],"answer":1,"why":"얼마 = how much."},{"q":"비싸요 means…","options":["cheap","expensive","free","new"],"answer":1,"why":"비싸요 = expensive."},{"q":"싸요 means…","options":["cheap","expensive","tasty","big"],"answer":0,"why":"싸요 = cheap."},{"q":"할인 means…","options":["receipt","discount","price","shop"],"answer":1,"why":"할인 = discount."},{"q":"이거 주세요 means…","options":["I see this","This, please","How much","I want go"],"answer":1,"why":"주세요 = please give."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Shopping worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Korean.","items":["price","discount","cheap"],"key":["가격","할인","싸요"]},{"instruction":"Shop talk.","items":["How much is this?","It's 100 won","This, please!"],"key":["이거 얼마예요","백 원이에요","이거 주세요"]},{"instruction":"React.","items":["Expensive!","Cheap!"],"key":["비싸요","싸요"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"A2 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Yesterday I read a book","answer":"어제 책을 읽었어요"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I want to eat kimchi","answer":"김치를 먹고 싶어요"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I go to school'","options":["학교에서 가요","학교에 가요","학교를 가요","학교에 공부해요"],"answer":"학교에 가요"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"생선을 좋아해요.","answer":"I like fish."},{"type":"fill","q":"학생___. (was)","answer":"이었어요"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I miss you!'","options":["보고 있어요","보고 싶어요","보고 싶었어요","볼 거예요"],"answer":"보고 싶어요"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 가요 / 여섯 시에","answer":"여섯 시에 가요"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 생선을 좋아해요.","answer":"생선을 좋아해요."},{"type":"fill","q":"이거 ___? (how much)","answer":"얼마예요"},{"type":"choose","q":"다녀오겠습니다!","options":["Welcome home","I'm off (and back)","Goodbye forever","Good night"],"answer":"I'm off (and back)"}]}}}